Description:
• development and implementation of comprehensive marketing strategies in line with the company's growth objectives;
• Head of PR initiatives for the positioning of HotelFriend as Thought Leader in hotel technology;
• establishing and maintaining relations with the media, specialist publications and influencers;
• Develop an AI visibility strategy (GEO/AISO) to ensure that HotelFriend is recommended in AI-based search tools and assistants such as ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity and Google AI Overviews;
• Managing the content strategy, optimized for traditional search and generative AI findability;
• analysis of market trends, competitive activities and identification of new opportunities;
• coordination with sales and product teams to coordinate messages and campaigns;
• Management and mentoring of team members in marketing;
• Representation of HotelFriend at industry conferences, fairs and media events;
• Monitoring of KPIs and regular reporting to the management.

Requirements:
• degree in marketing, communication, journalism or related fields;
• at least 5 years of marketing experience, of which at least 2 years in a leading position;
• German as a mother tongue or at a mother tongue level (written and oral) - mandatory;
• very good knowledge of English;
• proven success in PR campaigns and media work;
• Understanding the AI search landscape and Generative Engine Optimization (GEO) - how brands gain visibility in AI-generated responses;
• Experience with content strategies that work both in classic search and in AI channels;
• experience in the B2B-SaaS, hotel, tourism or technology sector;
• excellent communication, presentation and stakeholder management skills;
• strategic thinking with practical implementation;
• data-driven approach with experience in marketing analytics;
• proactive, creative and result-oriented personality.

Benefits:
• leadership with real influence on business development and growth;
• autonomy to implement your vision and ideas;
• Work at the top of the AI age in marketing and brand visibility;
• international environment with opportunities in several markets;
• direct communication with the management;
• friendly team culture and modern office in Leipzig;
• competitive salary and performance-related remuneration;
• Opportunity to design the brand of an innovative hotel technology company.
